# FlowRadar line-ending policy.
#
# This repo is developed on a Windows box with core.autocrlf=true, where a
# plain checkout smudges tracked text files to CRLF. A few tooling paths expect
# LF — most visibly a byte-exact source-snapshot test (apps/web
# test/framingBanner.test.ts) and shell scripts executed via tsx/node. The
# committed blobs are already LF; this file makes that explicit and guarantees
# LF working trees on every future checkout, so the CRLF class of failure
# cannot recur regardless of a contributor's autocrlf setting.
#
# NOTE: adding this file does NOT rewrite the current working tree; it governs
# future checkouts. No whole-repo renormalization was performed (the index is
# already LF-clean), keeping this a single-file, no-noise change.

# Auto-detect text vs binary; force LF in the working tree for all text files.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Explicit binary types — never touch their bytes / line endings.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.webp binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf  binary
*.eot  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.zip  binary
